   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Plans with the verb «ir»",
     "texto": [
      "In European Portuguese, the most common way to express immediate plans is the present of **ir** followed directly by the infinitive (without the preposition «a»): **vou visitar**, **vamos almoçar**, **eles vão ficar**.",
      "Expressing simple conditions: **Se chover, vamos ficar em casa** (if it rains, we are going to stay at home).",
      "Expressing times and moments: **depois do almoço** (after lunch), **às duas e meia** (at half past two)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
